MFEM NURBS mesh v1.0

# Quadratic (NURBS2) version of MFEM data/star.mesh.
# There is no curvature in this mesh - the Jacobian transformation is affine.
# Five tensor-product macro-patches; each has a 2 x 2 knot-span grid.
# Result after NURBS expansion: 20 quadrilateral elements, matching star.mesh.
# Internal knot multiplicity is 1, so geometry/basis is C1 inside each patch
# and C0 across the five patch interfaces.


